  "solution": "Given:\n\n59 * 12 * 6 * 24 * 2 * 105\n\n1. Option (1): −, +, −, +, =\n\nEquation: 59 − 12 + 6 − 24 + 2 = 105\n\n⇒ 59 - 12 + 6 - 24 + 2\n\n⇒ __**59 + 6 + 2**__ - (12 + 24)\n\n⇒ 68 - 36\n\n__**⇒ 32 ≠ 105**__\n\nHence, Option (1) is not correct.\n\n2. Option (2): ×, −, +, ×, =\n\nEquation: 59 × 12 - 6 + 24 × 2 = 105\n\n⇒ 708 - 6 + 48\n\n⇒ 702 + 48\n\n__⇒ 750 ≠ 105__\n\nHence the option (2) is not correct.\n\n3. Option (3): +, ×, +, −, =\n\nEquation: 59 + 12 × 6 + 24 - 2 = 105\n\n⇒ 59 + 72 + 24 - 2\n\n⇒155 - 2\n\n**⇒ 155 ≠ 153**\n\nHence the option (3) is not correct.\n\n4. Option (4): −, ÷, +, ×, =\n\nEquation: 59 - 12 ÷ 6 + 24 × 2 = 105\n\n⇒ 59 - 2 + 48\n\n⇒ 107 - 2 \n\n**⇒ 105 = 105**\n\nHence, the correct option is **Option (4)**.",
